<div class="info-page">
  <section class="info-hero">
    <span class="info-eyebrow">RETURNS & EXCHANGES</span>
    <h1>We Want You to Love It</h1>
    <p>If something doesn't feel right, we'll make it effortless to fix.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="info-body">
    <div class="info-content">

      <h2>Our Promise</h2>
      <p>
        Every Vivere piece is designed to feel extraordinary from the moment you put it on. But if it doesn't — for any reason — we offer a seamless 15-day return window. No friction, no fine print.
      </p>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <div class="info-steps">
        <div class="info-step">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Initiate</h3>
            <p>Visit your account, go to Order History, and select "Return Items" — or simply message us on WhatsApp.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-step">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Pack</h3>
            <p>Place the item in its original packaging. It should be unworn, unwashed, with tags attached.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-step">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>We Collect</h3>
            <p>We arrange complimentary pickup from your doorstep. No post office visits required.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-step">
          <span class="step-num">04</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Refund</h3>
            <p>Once received and inspected, your refund is processed within 5-7 business days to the original payment method.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <h2>Return Conditions</h2>
      <ul class="info-list">
        <li>Items must be unworn, unwashed, and in original condition</li>
        <li>Original tags must be attached</li>
        <li>Return must be initiated within 15 days of delivery</li>
        <li>Items must be in resalable condition</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <h2>Exchanges</h2>
      <p>
        Need a different size? We offer complimentary exchanges within 15 days. Reach out to us and we'll arrange a direct swap — no need to place a second order.
      </p>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <div class="info-help">
        <h2>Need Assistance?</h2>
        <p>Our team is here. <a href="/pages/contact">Get in touch</a> and we'll take care of it.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

